| Large module (1,805 lines, 62 importers in `play/src`): user requests, constraints, the `getUserMedia` pipeline, noise suppression, background effects, device lists, speaker selection, availability status and analytics dwell periods | `MediaStore.ts` | Split along the pinch points: constraints (P1, P4), the stream pipeline (P2, P3, P5) as one object that owns its state (MD-06), devices (P6), status and analytics | open (Phase 2+) |
| Long function with four error branches: `runRawStreamUpdate` (about 220 lines) | `:776-999` | Extract the track plan (which tracks to stop, keep warm, request) as a pure function of the old and new constraints and the live tracks; tests 3, 4 and 9 pin its effects | open |
| Derived store with 15 inputs whose callback keeps its dedup state in module variables | `mediaStreamConstraintsStore`, `:532-641` | Compute the constraints in a pure function of a named input record; keep the dedup inside the store | open |
